---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';
---

<section
  id="methodology"
  class="relative border-t border-white/[0.06] bg-ink-950/40 py-20 lg:py-28"
  aria-labelledby="methodology-heading"
>
  <div class="container-page">
    <div class="grid items-center gap-12 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <!-- Narrative Left -->
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">ANALYTICAL FRAMEWORK</span>
        <h2
          id="methodology-heading"
          class="mt-3 text-balance text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl"
        >
          Systematic Algorithmic Processing
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
          Investowl memproses transaksi bursa mentah, laporan kustodian KSEI, dan keterbukaan informasi emiten BEI melalui filter kuantitatif terstruktur.
        </p>

        <!-- 3 Items -->
        <ul class="mt-8 space-y-6">
          <li class="reveal flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-ink-900/40 p-4.5 backdrop-blur-sm">
            <span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-peach-400/30 bg-peach-400/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-peach-300">
              01
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Bandarmology Accumulation Matrix</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                Menghitung skor akumulasi institusi menggunakan protokol pelacakan broker tertimbang volume (VWAP flow) dan deteksi anomali transfer crossing.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="reveal flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-ink-900/40 p-4.5 backdrop-blur-sm" style="--reveal-delay: 80ms">
            <span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-peach-400/30 bg-peach-400/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-peach-300">
              02
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Wyckoff Phase Recognition</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                Pemetaan siklus struktural pasar otomatis dari fase akumulasi awal, spring, hingga breakout markup bervolume tinggi.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>

          <li class="reveal flex items-start gap-4 rounded-xl border border-white/[0.06] bg-ink-900/40 p-4.5 backdrop-blur-sm" style="--reveal-delay: 160ms">
            <span class="flex size-8 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-peach-400/30 bg-peach-400/10 font-mono text-xs font-bold text-peach-300">
              03
            </span>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-white">Foreign Flow Shock Analysis</h3>
              <p class="mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-slate-400">
                Mengidentifikasi lonjakan arus dana asing bernilai signifikan dan memisahkan posisi institusi global dari transaksi ritel jangka pendek.
              </p>
            </div>
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Right: Macro Grid Image Frame -->
      <div class="reveal relative" style="--reveal-delay: 100ms">
        <div class="absolute -inset-2 rounded-3xl bg-peach-400/[0.07] blur-2xl" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <div class="relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-white/12 bg-ink-900/90 shadow-[0_20px_50px_rgba(0,0,0,0.6)] backdrop-blur-xl">
          <!-- Terminal Top -->
          <div class="flex h-10 items-center justify-between border-b border-white/[0.08] bg-white/[0.025] px-4">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></span>
              <span class="size-2 rounded-full bg-slate-600"></span>
              <span class="ml-2 font-mono text-[10.5px] font-semibold text-slate-400">
                MACRO_METRIC_VECTOR_MATRIX.SVG
              </span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-[9px] font-bold text-peach-300">T+10 SYNC</span>
          </div>

          <div class="relative">
            <img
              src="/assets/resources/macro-grid.png"
              alt="Abstract high-tech financial metrics grid"
              width="600"
              height="420"
              class="h-auto w-full object-cover brightness-95"
              loading="lazy"
            />
            <div class="pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-ink-900/90 via-transparent to-transparent"></div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-t border-white/[0.08] bg-ink-900/95 p-3.5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
              <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-400"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-slate-300">Algorithmic Vector Engine Active</span>
            </div>
            <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold text-peach-300">LATENCY &lt; 0.5ms</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
